      "problem": "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to \\,-2}\\frac{3f(x)-g(x)}{x+2}.$ If the limit does not exist, write \"DNE\" (without the quotation marks).\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${lim}_{x\\to \\,-2}\\frac{3f(x)-g(x)}{x+2}\\,=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
