        "problem": "| $x$ | $f(x)$ | ${f}^{′}(x)$ | $g(x)$ | ${g}^{′}(x)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $-2$ | $2$ | $12$ | $6$ | $-4$ |\n| $2$ | $18$ | $12$ | $6$ | $4$ |\n\nThe functions $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ are differentiable for all real $x.$ Some values of $f(x),$ $g(x),$ and their derivatives are given in the table above.",
